<section class="scentiva-story color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} gradient">
  <div class="scentiva-story__inner page-width">
    <div class="scentiva-story__eyebrow">THE ART OF OLFACTION</div>
    <h1 class="scentiva-story__title">Our Story</h1>
    <p class="scentiva-story__intro">
      A fragrance is not simply worn. It becomes part of a place, a person, and a moment remembered long after it has passed.
    </p>

    <div class="scentiva-story__rule" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>

    <div class="scentiva-story__grid">
      <article class="scentiva-story__card">
        <span class="scentiva-story__number">01</span>
        <h2>THE BEGINNING</h2>
        <p>
          Scentiva was imagined around a simple idea: create fragrances that feel refined, expressive, and effortless to make part of everyday life.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="scentiva-story__card">
        <span class="scentiva-story__number">02</span>
        <h2>THE CRAFT</h2>
        <p>
          Each composition is approached as a balance of contrast — freshness and warmth, clarity and depth, familiar notes and unexpected details.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="scentiva-story__card">
        <span class="scentiva-story__number">03</span>
        <h2>THE MOMENT</h2>
        <p>
          From the first spray to the final trace, our fragrances are designed to become part of the moments you choose to remember.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="scentiva-story__closing">
      <p class="scentiva-story__closing-quote">“More than a scent. A story.”</p>
      <p class="scentiva-story__closing-copy">
        Discover a collection created for quiet confidence, memorable entrances, and everything in between.
      </p>
      <a class="button button--primary" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">EXPLORE THE COLLECTION</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .scentiva-story {
    background: rgb(var(--color-background));
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));
  }

  .scentiva-story__inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    padding-top: 92px;
    padding-bottom: 110px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .scentiva-story__eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .scentiva-story__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family), Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .scentiva-story__intro {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 34px auto 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .scentiva-story__rule {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 18px;
    margin: 52px auto 64px;
  }

  .scentiva-story__rule::before,
  .scentiva-story__rule::after {
    content: "";
    width: 105px;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.35;
  }

  .scentiva-story__rule span {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .scentiva-story__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .scentiva-story__card {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.25);
    padding: 28px 8px 10px;
  }

  .scentiva-story__number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    opacity: 0.65;
  }

  .scentiva-story__card h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family), Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .scentiva-story__card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .scentiva-story__closing {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 88px auto 0;
  }

  .scentiva-story__closing-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family), Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .scentiva-story__closing-copy {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 24px auto 32px;
    max-width: 560px;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .scentiva-story__closing .button {
    min-width: 240px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .scentiva-story__inner {
      padding-top: 62px;
      padding-bottom: 76px;
    }

    .scentiva-story__intro {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .scentiva-story__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 42px;
    }

    .scentiva-story__closing {
      margin-top: 64px;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Scentiva Our Story",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Scentiva Our Story"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
